@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-03 Submit Asset Request

|Supervisor (Mobile App)|
start
:Navigate to "Asset Requests" tab;
:Select material or equipment needed for the next day;
:Enter required quantity;
:Specify needed date;
:Click "Submit Request";

|System|
if (Active internet connection?) then (Yes)
  :Save request to database with "Pending" status;
  :Trigger alert for the Manager;
  :Display success confirmation message;
else (No)
  :Cache request data locally on device;
  :Display "Saved Offline" message;
  note right
    Background process will auto-sync
    and alert Manager when connection
    is restored
  end note
endif

stop
@enduml
